| logical_plan  | Sort: Returns_Loss DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |   Projection: call_center.cc_call_center_id AS Call_Center, call_center.cc_name AS Call_Center_Name, call_center.cc_manager AS Manager, sum(catalog_returns.cr_net_loss) AS Returns_Loss                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[call_center.cc_call_center_id, call_center.cc_name, call_center.cc_manager, customer_demographics.cd_marital_status, customer_demographics.cd_education_status]], aggr=[[sum(catalog_returns.cr_net_loss)]]                                                                                                                                                                       |
